WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.600
What are we doing?

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.020
We're walking, Greg.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:44.850
But where?

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.520
A place to wait out this rain.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.210
Oh. But...

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.280
shouldn't we wait for Beatrice?

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.280
I don't need Beatrice.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.780
I-I'll figure this out on my own.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.020
Oh, that's good.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.780
I'm glad you have a plan.

00:00:59.110 --> 00:00:59.780
Hey, Wirt?

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:00.620
What?

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.070
So, what's the plan?

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.460
Cause you're not saying any details, so it's hard for me...

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:06.020
Greg! I do have a plan.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:07.280
And if you don't trust me,

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.880
then you don't have to follow me, okay?!

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.880
If you want to go look for Beatrice, go ahead.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.490
You can do anything you want.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.890
Anything?!

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:17.410
That's a lot of power.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.260
Wirt!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.260
Oh, no! Did I knock down that tree with my powers?

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:22.680
Sorry. Are you okay?

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:23.590
Yeah.

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:25.690
That tree just came at me out of nowhere.

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:28.230
Greg, look... ax marks.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:29.690
Someone chopped it down.

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:30.610
Indeed.

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:31.860
It was I.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.150
Stop! Listen!

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:36.810
The beast knows your presence!

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:37.950
Ready to claim you

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.780
as part of his dark forest,

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.620
but only if you give up!

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.000
Keep hearty in both body and spirit

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.910
and you shall be safe from him.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:49.470
Fall ill or lose hope,

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:52.500
and your life shall pass into his crooked hands.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.670
Ugh! Children!

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.360
Please, heed my warning!

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:00.920
Boys, beware the beast!

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:01.770
Woodsman!

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:02.060
Huh?

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.390
We should talk.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.230
I think we lost him.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.000
Haha! You got him with the old

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:13.780
kick-er-oo!

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.640
See? I got it under control.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:17.030
I-I don't need Beatrice.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.080
Now, to find someplace to wait out this rain...

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:20.770
As long as it's not that old, broken down...

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:21.950
Whoa. Shh!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.200
It's perfect! Come on, Greg!

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:27.790
Uh, Wirt...

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:30.280
Ain't that just the way?

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.770
This place isn't so bad.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:35.300
...Huh?

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:35.910
Maybe!

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.910
♪ Dum dum-dum dum-dum
dum dum ♪

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.090
Get that frog out of your pants.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:41.260
He can do what he wants.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.280
Hey, what's in these old baskets?

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:44.760
Woaaaah!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:45.370
What?

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:46.410
We're rich!

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.060
What?

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.600
Look!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.600
It's full of black turtles!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.600
We're turtle rich!

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:52.880
You know,

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:56.610
it's kind of funny, finding a basket of turtles in an abandoned house, huh?

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.610
Haha, Yeah.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:58.610
Ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.610
Greg, not that kind of funny.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.610
Huh? Oh.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:02.620
Auntie?

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.370
Auntie, I finished sorting...

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.120
Huh!

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:05.700
Huh!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:06.790
Who are you?!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:07.790
We're burglars!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:08.790
N-No, n-no.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:09.650
W-W-We're not...

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.180
We just needed to get out of the rain,

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:13.100
a-and we thought this place was abandoned...

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.490
...so we came here to burgle your turts.

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:16.400
No, it's not true.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.800
It is true!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.720
Oh, okay. I give up.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.390
Ha! See?

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.900
I believe you, but, please...

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.140
hide yourselves at once.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.890
Auntie Whispers is coming soon.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.890
Uh, what?

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:36.150
Hide, quickly!

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.570
Welcome home, Auntie.

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:42.080
Lorna, my sweet child.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:43.570
Sniff, sniff, sniff

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:48.080
Hmm. Has anyone come here today?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.650
Nay, auntie... not a soul.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.600
Then no one shall be...

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.260
devoured alive tonight?

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.100
Nay, I pray not, ma'am.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.340
Devoured alive?

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.190
You're a good girl, Lorna,

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:00.420
but you deceive me.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.340
I speak the truth, Auntie.
I swear.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.430
Deceive me not, child!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.690
I can smell them.
Sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.850
I can smell the children in this house.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.020
What? Children?

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.410
I-I'm, like... in high school.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:12.850
Yeah, well, you still stink.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:13.340
Shh!

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:14.100
You "shh."

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.110
Tell me where you are
hiding them,

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.020
precious one.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.190
I...

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.690
The ringing of the bell commands you.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.950
Look...

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.030
in the basket.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:32.540
You have entered the house of doom, children...

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.040
your doom.

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.880
Oh, My dear.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.380
Why, all along, you meant it be the turtles

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.880
that smell so ripe.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.470
A-A-Aye.
T-That is what I meant.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.470
Mm.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:50.390
Then you have no evil secrets to keep?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.970
Nay. I have none.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.560
Then off to bed go I,

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:56.820
and you, Lorna...

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:01.320
you shall sort the bones of those who have been eaten here before.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.900
I have finished already.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.490
Then clean this floor until it shines.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.910
The ringing of the bell commands you.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.580
Yes, Auntie Whispers.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.480
You know I do this for you, child.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:20.080
Keeping you busy is the only
way to keep the evil spirit

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.760
from driving you to wickedness.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.060
Do not worry, Auntie Whispers.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.760
The work shall keep me busy.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.100
Good night, my dear.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.820
And dowse that fire.

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:34.850
I did not ask you to light it.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.360
Come out, my turtles.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.360
She sleeps.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.530
You sure?

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.530
Aye.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.910
Uh, are you all right?

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.330
Y-You've been coughing a lot.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.080
It's my illness.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.410
It's the reason Auntie Whispers is so hard on me.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.620
Gosh! That lady is so bad.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.000
Y-You should go see a doctor.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.210
Auntie does not allow visitors here.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.510
She believes outsiders will lead me to become wicked.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.060
Yeah. See?

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:08.510
That's super weird.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.340
I-I don't mean to insult your family, but...

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.680
Oh, she's not my real aunt.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.100
Oh, my gosh. See?!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.460
Hey, where'd Dr. Cucumber go?

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.600
Hey, I'm gonna get you!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.610
So, you got to keep sweeping till you're done?

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:21.360
Mm-hmm.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.690
The work never ends.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.360
By the time this task is complete,

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.360
she will return and order me to a new task,

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.860
and so it goes.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.450
I-If I help and we get the work done fast,

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.450
maybe you can...

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.290
Escape?

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.200
With you?!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.870
Yeah.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.290
Can we escape with you, too?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.290
Greg...

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.290
Yes. Perhaps this...

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.160
this time it could be different.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.050
Here.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:48.880
- Huh!
- Huh!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.970
Uh, I'll take that side.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.660
Mm, something weird is going on.

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:56.340
Graawr

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.810
Where are you going?

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:58.830
♪ Here we are ♪

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.540
♪ The two of us, ♪

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:06.230
- ♪ Like ships upon a winding river ♪

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:06.230
- ♪ Like ships upon a winding river ♪

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.240
- ♪ and yet, somehow ♪

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.240
- ♪ and yet, somehow ♪

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.740
- ♪ we found each other ♪
- ♪ we found each other ♪

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:17.910
- ♪ like strangers, you and I ♪
- ♪ like strangers, you and I ♪

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:21.330
Hey! You can run and you can hide!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.120
Paging Dr. Cucumber!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:27.840
You're needed in the operating ro-o-o-o-o-o-o-om!

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:27.840
Graawr

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.550
Well, looks pretty good.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:30.320
I think we're done.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.010
Aahh!

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.410
Why have you come here?

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:33.760
Oops!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.180
You shan't remain alive for long in this house.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.180
Aahh!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.850
I'm warning you, children...

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.350
keep away from my Lorna,

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.350
or you shall be hastily

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.440
gobbled up!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.650
We... we don't want no trouble, lady.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.720
Let's just talk it out.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.530
I'm Wirt.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.610
Lorna, come here.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.450
The ringing of the bell comman...

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.020
uh, where...

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:55.950
Did I put the bell on my nightstand?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:56.950
Follow me.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.700
Noooooooo!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.750
Come out before it is too late.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.460
Unlock this door.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.720
She will devour you.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.460
What is she talking about?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.220
- Ah!
- Ah!

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.130
More bones to sort.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.220
- Ah!
- No!

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.800
I told you boys to stay away from her,

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.310
but now you've gone and made her wicked again.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.920
Hu-hoh, For some reason,

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.210
I thought that old lady was the people-eater,

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.220
but it was Lorna all along.

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:27.040
It just goes to show you stuff.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.730
Now I have a plan that'll ... Ugh!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.650
Haha! Your plan was better.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.160
I'm sorry, my turtles...

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.740
...but I must feed!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.360
Greg!

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.080
Let's try my plan now.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:48.250
The ringing of the bell commands you.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.500
What the...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.510
Oh. He ate the witch's magic bell when...

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.750
F-Fine! Do something.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.750
Oh. I command you to...

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.850
The spirit compels me...

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.850
Transform into a magical tiger.

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.430
The ringing... the ringing of the bell commands you!

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:05.440
Stop making Lorna do bad stuff, spirit!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.860
And also go away and don't come back.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.860
Lorna! Lorna!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:14.900
Wirt, look!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:19.410
Lorna!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.410
Wirt, you saved me.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.830
Lorna? Lorna?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.030
Oh, my Lorna.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.290
Auntie Whispers!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.170
I thought they'd stolen you away.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.640
No, Auntie. They saved me.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:32.170
They banished the evil spirit

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:33.920
with the power of the bell!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.260
You can have it back after Greg Jr. goes to the bathroom.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.860
Oh, Lorna...

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.430
that's wonderful, dear.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.270
Auntie Whispers, what's wrong?

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:46.270
Well, now that you're cured,

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.860
you won't be needing old Auntie Whispers any more to look after you.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:52.020
Oh, Auntie, no.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.030
Ohh.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.030
I would never leave you.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.530
You are my family.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.950
Ah? Ohh.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.730
Thank you so much, Wirt.

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:02.030
And a bit of advice...

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.490
beware of my sister, Adelaide.

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:06.790
She lives in the pasture.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.490
She must not be trusted.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.130
Perhaps I'll see you again someday.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.130
I hope so.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.470
Smell you later.

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.030
Wow, Wirt!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.970
You saved the day twice today!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.340
Yeah, I guess.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.140
But so what?

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.490
We're still not any closer to getting home.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.980
I just don't know what I'm doing out here anymore.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.810
I don't know if we'll ever get back home.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:31.990
Sure, we will!

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.400
What can stop us?

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.400
You got a plan, remember?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.120
I lied.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.400
Aw, come on.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.930
Let's go, captain!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:40.280
Lead the way!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.410
You can do it!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.810
Yes. Yes

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:46.980
Yes. Yes

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.360
Yes. Yes

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.670
Yes. Yes

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.340
Yes. Yes

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.510
Yes. Yes

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.510
One cannot trade the souls of children

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.000
as if they were tokens!

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.350
There has to be another way.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.520
No. There is only me.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.520
No. There is only me.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.520
No. There is only me.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.690
No. There is only me.

